WEBVTT

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:23.710
<i>Long night under the
midnight sun, I'd gone numb</i>

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:28.630
<i>Disparaging mutters are
meaningless, aren't they?</i>

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:33.550
<i>The light sputtering, dying away in my heart</i>

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:38.470
<i>If I could just grasp it</i>

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:42.850
<i>Come on, rise to tomorrow!</i>

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:50.900
<i>When the awakening comes, let loose
a passionate aria, an unending song</i>

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:55.990
<i>A breathtaking judgment that
echoes in the chambers of the heart</i>

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>You can never unsee it</i>

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.330
<i>Two libidos with a chance to meet</i>

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:10.550
<i>If you seek an era without
overhunting, look no further</i>

00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Dancing together stirs our blood,
we rend the veil of darkness</i>

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:27.440
<i>Together in front of the door,
we're flooded with adrenaline,</i>

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.940
<i>Bewitched by the devil</i>

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.030
"Tarantella of Desire and Deceit"

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.290
Lindo?

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:53.710
Ritsuka... stay with me...

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:58.220
I'm here. It's all right.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.270
Come back down, kitty!

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:08.940
Kitty!

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.860
What's wrong, Ritsuka?

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.270
There's a kitty stuck up there.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.570
What do we do? Poor thing!

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:19.070
Ritsuka?

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.620
Hold this.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.790
Big brother?

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.420
Are you okay, Lindo?

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:32.960
Come here. I won't hurt you.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:37.050
Come on!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:41.890
Lindo!

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:47.310
Big brother...

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:55.360
If I really am the grimoire,

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.280
I should be able to heal Lindo's wounds.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:03.370
After all he's done for me...

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.580
Ritsuka, get inside!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.920
But the flowers'll get flattened!

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:14.340
It's okay--I'll build them an enclosure.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.630
I'll help!

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:17.670
Just get inside!

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:19.970
Uh-huh...

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.690
What's up, Ritsuka?

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:34.520
I'm sorry, big brother.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.400
This is all my fault.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.950
No--it's 'cause I'm still weak.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:47.030
I've got to get stronger so I can protect you.

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:50.200
Ritsuka, I have feelings for you.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.790
I love you--more than anyone else.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.670
Oh, right!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.550
Some food... and something to drink.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:06.470
You'll be fine, right? I'm coming right back.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:17.400
"Closed today after festival"

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.070
Hello?

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.070
Is anybody here?

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:35.420
Hope no one minds if I take some.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:50.930
So the school festival is really over.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:55.350
Explains why no one's around today.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:15.330
Listen: the grimoire itself <i>is</i> the great power

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:19.540
that allows whoever holds it
to control the world.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.210
Power...

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:30.600
Yikes--I've got to get back to Lindo right away.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.820
So this is where you've been.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:50.660
Here!

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.740
A souvenir from Vienna.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.540
And the exorcists?

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.500
Crushed, of course.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.000
Did you even have to ask?

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.290
They thrilled me not one bit.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:03.000
I see.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.800
What, that's it?

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.800
What do you mean?

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:12.050
Let's have some compensation
for bein' treated like clowns!

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:12.930
Clowns?

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:16.140
Yeah! First you trick us,
then we gotta blow off some punks?

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.690
It's enough to make you cry!

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:22.230
I wonder who we are to you, Rem.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:26.990
Not that the word "friends"
would ever pass your lips.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:32.240
Enough of that! For devils,
status and tradition is everything.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.910
I have no time to consider
such half-hearted rubbish!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:40.460
How unlike you. That scheme
of yours was plenty half-hearted.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:42.960
What scheme?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:48.340
You know. The grimoire was
never in Vienna to begin with.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:51.550
You didn't want to find the grimoire,

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:55.390
you just wanted to keep us away from it--

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.520
Away from Ritsuka Tachibana.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.520
What's this nonsense?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.400
Are you calling me a liar?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.060
This is stupid.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.900
Then give her to me.

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:12.620
The grimoire belongs to the Arlond family.
And I'm okay with that.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.030
But I want the girl.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.790
What the hell, you jerk?!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.420
She's mine!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.170
Her laugh, her teary face--all of it!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:28.710
I won't let anyone else have my butterfly.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.510
She's... my pet.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.680
Hands off the grimoire!

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.480
So she's important to you, too.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.860
Do you love her?

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.900
Want to make her yours?

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:57.870
What is all this? Why this drivel?
What are you, human?

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:03.580
So it's drivel. You might be a devil,
but your feelings don't lie.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:04.880
Well, Rem?

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.130
That's the grimoire.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.170
But it's Ritsuka Tachibana.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.800
Same thing!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:23.140
If you're going to keep telling lies
instead of the truth...

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.940
...we can't trust you.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:44.790
♪ Enough already--we're sick of your lies ♪

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:50.300
♪ Just accept the feelings you pushed aside ♪

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:55.720
Feelings? I don't have such lowly things.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:09:00.890
♪ Cut the crap! You tryin' to play it cool? ♪

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:06.350
♪ No more excuses, just say it:
You're not after her--you want her ♪

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:11.480
As if. She's the grimoire... that's all!

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:16.910
♪ You're wrong--she's a girl,
an oh-so-fragile human ♪

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:25.540
♪ You must have noticed how beloved her thorns ♪

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.330
"Beloved"?

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.210
♪ Spit it out already! ♪

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:30.460
♪ Don't be chicken! ♪

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.500
♪ I can't hear you! ♪

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:38.090
♪ You can't hide your true self
any longer: emo liar ♪

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:41.680
♪ Seriously--it's a real pain ♪

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:47.560
♪ The sweet little light that
brightened up your gloomy days ♪

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:52.820
♪ The feelings born of sensing that warmth ♪

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:57.990
♪ The world that turns with that gentle touch ♪

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:03.540
♪ Let the battle begin:
who'll have this fleeting love? ♪

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:08.920
♪ Can't rule anyone out--play dirty or play fair ♪

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.460
♪ Make it clear! ♪

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.710
♪ What a pain! ♪

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.840
♪ Just admit it! ♪

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:19.510
♪ Your own frank emotions: emo liar ♪

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.970
♪ Don't be stupid--we're getting antsy ♪

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:28.770
♪ Now's the time--tell us:
what do you think of her? ♪

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:31.230
♪ Well? ♪

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:36.860
♪ Well, tell us already! ♪

00:10:55.170 --> 00:11:00.180
Daughter of man, holder of
the forbidden grimoire's power...

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.260
Come with me.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:10.850
For your mother's sake,
and for that of your foolish, brave knight.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.150
Mom... and Lindo?

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:17.070
We used to be human, too.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:22.030
We know the love of parent and child,
the kindness of siblings.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.490
That's why we've been taking
such good care of her...

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.830
...your mother, that is.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:32.290
Taking care of--but she was
abducted out of the blue!

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.040
You could say that.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:38.130
Quit messing with me!
You're lying about Mom, aren't you?

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:42.590
Lying? Why would I need to lie to you?

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:47.140
Or would you rather fall
into the hands of the devils?

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:49.730
I don't need to trick you.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:55.190
If I had to, I could deal with you
more easily than this apple.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:07.490
Sweet. I wonder if this
is how your blood tastes.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:10.000
Y-You're a vampire?!

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.470
I'll be right back, okay?

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.390
Thank you... big brother.

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:38.940
Done already? That was a quick goodbye.

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.360
The sooner we go, the sooner I can get back.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.000
Pardon me!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.170
Hey! Watch where you're goin'!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:02.380
L-Lord Jek! She's with you?

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:03.550
What if she is?

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.180
How very rude of me!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.640
I hate humans.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:12.140
Always changing their attitude
to suit their audience.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.830
Is my mother all right?

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.540
Of course.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:39.330
Vampires detest lies and base acts.
Not like devils.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:40.590
What do you mean?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:46.090
Just what I said.
Devils are truly the lowest of the low.

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:07.320
Mom!

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:11.410
Quiet. Don't wake her.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:13.540
She's dreaming...

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.000
...a very happy dream.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.880
Her blood! You--

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:24.670
One or two feedings won't make her a vampire.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:29.890
We don't care to increase
our numbers willy-nilly.

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:31.220
Mom...

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.360
Ritsuka!

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:50.910
Forget it. It's just stupid to do this up here.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:54.700
Yeah. Guess we gotta find the grimoire first.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:15:00.750
Now that we know Maksis is around,
I'd hate for him to get it.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:05.460
Dammit! I'd like to find that mutt
and hurt him but good--

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.670
At least till he tells us where Maksis is!

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:13.600
Let sleeping dogs lie. You want to
make even <i>more</i> trouble for us?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:17.520
So we search for the grimoire.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:23.230
Rem, we haven't forgotten
that you're the Arlond family heir.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:27.110
Just like we haven't forgotten
that Maksis is an enemy to us all.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:28.280
But...

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.660
As long as you won't give us an answer,

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.490
don't think you'll be getting the grimoire.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:43.040
You think it's poisoned or something?

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.920
What are you going to do?

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.510
Let's see... How about a fairy tale?

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:53.390
Once upon a time, there was a professor

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:57.140
who meant to gather the answers
to all the world's mysteries.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:16:00.140
What this professor wanted to know about most

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.890
was the forbidden grimoire.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.900
And the devils found out.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:10.610
Once the professor had
the grimoire and its mysteries,

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:15.700
one devil, intent on tricking him,
put on human form

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.700
and grew close to him.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:23.170
The professor had a daughter
both beautiful and wise.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:28.840
The devil king wanted her as well...
and took her.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:32.720
From their union a child was born.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:38.260
She was the first human
born of royal devil blood in 615 years,

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:44.520
and in her slept the power of the grimoire
that would rule the world.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:47.940
The devil king was overjoyed.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.150
With this daughter, he would rule
not only the demon realm,

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:56.200
but all heaven and earth would be his as well.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.660
The king's name was Maksis;

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.740
his wife, Maria;

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:04.620
and their daughter... was named Ritsuka.

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:13.840
Yes: your father is the devil king.

00:17:15.550 --> 00:17:17.180
Ritsuka...

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.850
Mom?

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.020
Mom!

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:27.230
Ritsuka... you poor girl...

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.980
Mom...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.980
I'm sorry, Ritsuka.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:34.740
No, it's all right.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:38.620
Such... such heavy shackles...

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:44.450
A human body holding superhuman power...

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:50.790
You're human, yet not:
the devil king's blood in a human vessel.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:55.050
This power was forced onto you, drawing you in,

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:59.890
and you can't do a thing about it.
I feel for you.

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:01.390
Good.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.430
What?

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:08.480
All this time,
I didn't understand myself at all.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:11.770
I'm just a normal high-school girl,

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.820
yet all these things keep happening around me...

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:17.610
All these people getting hurt...

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:22.830
I wondered why I had to go through all that.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:27.960
It's because I'm the devil king's daughter.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:31.210
So there <i>is</i> something weird about me.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:36.550
And that's why I made everyone suffer,
caused so many problems...

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.760
We can save you, you know.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:46.730
Save me? You won't fool me
with that kind of talk.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:51.610
It's true. The vampire king knows how.

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.230
The vampire... king?

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:59.070
The ruler of destruction and confusion:
Lord Nesta.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:04.660
The devils have long hated
and oppressed us vampires.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:08.080
But all that's over.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:12.790
Lord Nesta will defeat the devils
and claim the demon realm as his own.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:19.930
And Lord Nesta can remove the power
of the grimoire from you.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:24.970
Once our king, Lord Nesta,
has the power of the grimoire,

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:28.180
even the devil king Maksis
will be no match for him!

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:31.650
Wait--How exactly would he take it out?

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:39.740
Beats me. Only Lord Nesta knows,
and he's not telling us underlings.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:47.160
But you're out of options here.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:51.330
Either submit yourself to
Lord Nesta's power or end it here,

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.460
you and your mother both.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:00.920
Come, Ritsuka... to Lord Nesta!

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:19.940
Right this way.

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:21.950
Wait--What about my mother?

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:26.570
Don't worry. I told you, vampires hate lies.

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:35.460
I'll go. Take me to the vampire king.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:54.690
Once Lord Nesta annihilates the devils

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:57.440
and claims the demon realm for us vampires,

00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:00.940
we won't care what happens to you humans.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:03.900
You can go back to your regular lives

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:06.570
and live happily ever after.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:07.910
You know,

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.330
just like in a fairy tale.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.500
Is this...

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:20.960
Ritsuka...

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:28.930
Ritsuka... where are you?

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.670
<i>It's a secret you can't tell anyone</i>

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:10.260
<i>Wonth gir sliv edhti wecnad</i>

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.720
<i>Wonth gir</i>

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:17.350
<i>Cracking a smile only at the witching hour</i>

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:20.270
<i>Spreading rumors sotto voce</i>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.820
<i>You knocked on the door</i>

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:26.360
<i>Without looking behind you</i>

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:30.030
<i>With all these mysteries, impossible to solve</i>

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>You stopped cold, weak in the knees</i>

00:22:32.950 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>It hacks everything</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.750
<i>The curse of love</i>

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.000
<i>The curse--and you</i>

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:44.420
<i>If you're confused about the touch on your skin</i>

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:48.050
<i>We just can't be transparent</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:51.800
<i>Soon (soon)</i>

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>Won't you take this hand?</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:02.310
<i>Mademoiselle, mademoiselle:
I'll make you happy</i>

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:06.110
<i>This night will never come again</i>

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:08.990
<i>So let us swear to one another</i>

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:16.290
<i>The black clown singing of love
at the tip of the moon</i>

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:18.120
<i>Obscuring the sky</i>

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:23.040
<i>Casting a spell with a bewitching fever</i>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:29.420
--Ritsuka... Ritsuka... Ritsuka...

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:31.380
--This is your fate.
--Ritsuka... Ritsuka... Ritsuka...

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:35.680
--Ritsuka... Ritsuka... Ritsuka...

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:41.020
"Samba of Jet and Crimson"

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:41.020
Act 11: Samba of Jet and Crimson.
